    "detailed_description": "Pokaban is a puzzle game where you push cards around to make poker hands. There are marked positions that correlate to a poker hand on the screen. Once enough cards are added to a hand it will be compared with the dealer's hand. If all of your hands beat the dealer then you win the match!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play</h2><br>Push cards:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/1114981cc0a0800599f74301a343248d.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/1114981cc0a0800599f74301a343248d.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/1114981cc0a0800599f74301a343248d.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>When pushed into a slot the card is added to a hand<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/7424de7cd129423b56db7ccbaf52ea7f.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/7424de7cd129423b56db7ccbaf52ea7f.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/7424de7cd129423b56db7ccbaf52ea7f.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Once a hand is completed it will be compared with the dealer<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/64e3f3eab67922ff062362657be92227.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/64e3f3eab67922ff062362657be92227.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/64e3f3eab67922ff062362657be92227.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You cannot <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/16d7d8829fb73f9c461ca12ce8d776df.webp?t=1667315837\" /></div></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/16d7d8829fb73f9c461ca12ce8d776df.webp?t=1667315837\" /></div> Push more than one card<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/5b316f439455e035631d8211fe571aab.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/5b316f439455e035631d8211fe571aab.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/5b316f439455e035631d8211fe571aab.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/16d7d8829fb73f9c461ca12ce8d776df.webp?t=1667315837\" /></div> Pull cards<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/de83f61d2da05eb5f96b826b9bcebb4c.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/de83f61d2da05eb5f96b826b9bcebb4c.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s