steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/9c6bca5fa35822c27a6449d9206fcb16.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/9c6bca5fa35822c27a6449d9206fcb16.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/9c6bca5fa35822c27a6449d9206fcb16.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Suit Swap</h2><br>Placing a card onto a position marked with another suit will swap the suits of both cards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/4584d72b2ac4316b1e71bd6028249b3e.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/4584d72b2ac4316b1e71bd6028249b3e.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/4584d72b2ac4316b1e71bd6028249b3e.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hand</h2><br>Add cards to your hand<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/062790ffe8388f4bcd3f7322d82092f3.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/062790ffe8388f4bcd3f7322d82092f3.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/062790ffe8388f4bcd3f7322d82092f3.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic