ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/de83f61d2da05eb5f96b826b9bcebb4c.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wild</h2><br>Wild cards can take the place of any other card. It makes creating poker hands more challenging. Like other cards you can place wild cards into marked positions to add to your hand.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/aa5612689981197829e4dbff761fbaa4.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/aa5612689981197829e4dbff761fbaa4.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/aa5612689981197829e4dbff761fbaa4.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Positions on the game board can be marked as wild. Placing a card there will turn all cards sharing the rank and suit into wild cards. Be careful though this will affect the dealer' cards as well.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/36cfc3cddc693305f399749260485587.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/36cfc3cddc693305f399749260485587.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/36cfc3cddc693305f399749260485587.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>These modifiers affect the dealer's cards as well so use them carefully.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/9c6bca5fa35822c27a6449d9206fcb16.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/9c6bca5fa35822c27a6449d9206fcb16.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/9c6bca5fa35822c27a6449d9206fcb16.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Suit Swap</h2><br>Placing a card onto a position marked with another suit will swap the suits of both cards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/4584d72b2ac4316b1e71bd6028249b3e.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/4584d72b2ac4316b1e71bd6028249b3e.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/4584d72b2ac4316b1e71bd6028249b3e.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hand</h2><br>Add cards to your hand<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/062790ffe8388f4bcd3f7322d82092f3.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/062790ffe8388f4bcd3f7322d82092f3.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/062790ffe8388f4bcd3f7322d82092f3.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/761af4512bdf5907f06a4a45689baf59.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/761af4512bdf5907f06a4a45689baf59.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/761af4512bdf5907f06a4a45689baf59.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Throw cards from your hand<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/0a181e72a6f948c238a65a6bd1290bbc.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/0a181e72a6f948c238a65a6bd1290bbc.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/0a181e72a6f948c238a65a6bd1290bbc.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Additional features<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create and share custom levels with friends and strangers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/b36bcfb53d2b355fc2b0db70b95497eb.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/b36bcfb53d2b355fc2b0db70b95497eb.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/b36bcfb53d2b355fc2b0db70b95497eb.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Unlimited undo/redo movement.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/f4c43391ca0179dc1a28944cb5f20c4f.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/f4c43391ca0179dc1a28944cb5f20c4f.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/f4c43391ca0179dc1a28944cb5f20c4f.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Fully configurable keyboard/gamepad mapping<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/33313019c3b7a5afa21b02a424b05dd0.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/33313019c3b7a5afa21b02a424b05dd0.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/33313019c3b7a5afa21b02a424b05dd0.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> 60+ hand-made levels<br></li><li> Relaunch right where you left off<br></li><li> Stars track progress and show achievement<br></li><li> Unobtrusive hint system<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/5f612249a5d8db4e5492f1404d4ee15c.poster.avif?t=1667315837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/5f612249a5d8db4e5492f1404d4ee15c.webm?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937170/extras/5f612249a5d8db4e5492f1404d4ee15c.mp4?t=1667315837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul></h2>",
